# =============================================================================
# Vite (copy this file to .env.local)
# =============================================================================
# Only names prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to the browser — never put secrets
# in VITE_*.
#
# The current app does not read any VITE_* variables (map style is fixed in
# code; API calls use same-origin /api).

# =============================================================================
# Lambda / SAM — same variable names as template.yaml / sam/env.json
# =============================================================================
# These are NOT read by Vite. They ARE merged into SAM local when you run
# `npm run sam:local` or `npm run dev:stack` (see scripts/sam-local.mjs).
# You can still use sam/env.json instead or on top of .env (sam/env.json wins).
#
# SearchAreasFunction
# TFL_APP_KEY=
# ORS_API_KEY=
# UKHPI_LIVE=0
#
# GeocodeWorkplaceFunction
# MAPBOX_ACCESS_TOKEN=
# GEOCODE_RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE=30
#
# Deploy: pass Parameters (TflAppKey, OrsApiKey, …) or set in AWS console.
